	"data": "Custom RAG Pipeline — Architecture Map\n\nMerged from projects/ and CustomRag/ notes. The pipeline is complete and operational.\n\nKey facts:\nVector DB: Qdrant on star:6333 (systemd)\nCollection: calcifer-vault — dense (qwen3-embedding:4b, 2560-dim) + native BM25 sparse\nFusion: Server-side RRF via Qdrant Query API\nStatus: ✅ M1-M8 complete. Pipeline operational, AnythingLLM decommissioned 2026-04-18.\n\nQuick Reference\nCLI: PYTHONPATH=scripts python -m vault_rag search \"query\" --top 5\nFallback:…",
